    "martial_power_contribution": "at +14/+15 add9/14 times coefficient to accepted attack-martial flat skill-power component once before existing phase/passive power calculations; ordinary attacks/healing/status do not receive martial flat power",
    "contribution_category": "real_enhancement only; not attribute_stone, synthesis, weapon_base, gems, awakening or temporary boost; Lu attribute-stone double excludes both attack and martial fields",
    "active_group_only": true,
    "weapon_stage_change": "recompute coefficient from explicit target definition when a named progression recipe changes stage; retaining enhancement never means retaining old cached bonus in addition to target bonus",
    "persisted_inputs": "definition ID and actual enhancement; no persistent cached derived attack or martial power",
    "random": "未选符沿tier基础概率；选5%/10%/15%符按optional_luck_charm_owner_ref计算有效概率。有效10000不抽样，其余房主从0..9999均匀单抽，draw<有效bp成功；不另抽幸运符随机。",
    "success": "same instance ID, enhancement+1 only; consumes exact stone count and fee",
    "failure": "same instance ID and enhancement; consumes exact stone count and fee; every other source field unchanged; no destruction or downgrade",
    "rank15": "reject before quote/charge/random, no enhancement16 recipe",
    "does_not_grant": "no character rank/weapon stage/true conversion/quest reward/qigong point or gemstone improvement"
  },
