    "preview": "show source item and real enhancement, success probability, success/failure states, both resource costs and resulting typed attack/martial contribution; no implied protection-symbol selection",
    "commit": "validate all source and resource fields, calculate material removal/final capacity+weight on copy, clone random state and draw if required, commit cost/instance/random/revisions/receipt together",
    "weight_and_capacity": "same source instance remains in its slot; only material count decreases, never creates a replacement weapon or extra slot; cannot use processing to legitimize bad overweight snapshot",
    "cancel_or_invalid": "no fee, stone, RNG state or revision change; never pre-roll quote",
    "deduplication": "host serializes each character; look up original command receipt before current enhancement validation; same command same payload returns same outcome without new draw, altered payload rejects",
    "preservation": "synthesis and every other registered source field remain byte-equivalent, not reset on success/failure",
    "save_failure": "retain committed memory outcome/unsaved flag and same random state; retry save rather than repeat business transaction",
    "lan": "host owns requester character checks, RNG, exact materials and silver; other party members cannot contribute or gain item",
    "load": "reject enhancement outside0..15, missing definition/binding, duplicate instance or inconsistent receipt; do not clamp or repair",
    "optional_charm": "optional_charm_selector必须显式null或指定真实随身5%/10%/15%符堆及预期修订/数量1；报价/摘要/消费/有效概率/随机/收据沿optional_luck_charm_owner_ref，成功失败都消费一张；原必成档选符拒绝。",
